From: SteveDeFacto <5148995+SteveDeFacto@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 02:08:38 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 19/19] Compose A's policy and Windows verifier E2Es with the
 proof-aware gateway

Same conflict and same test-only fix as fb1c410b for A's lease-reader and head E2Es: P's gateway
refuses to offer pinned witnesses without a verifier, and policy-verifier.e2e (2efc/437d) and
windows-verifier.e2e (df8fbafa) construct it without one. The gateway gets the witness-check helper
and a root store; each feed signs the block's real parent beacon root and pushes the head to the root
store before serving it. Scenarios and assertions are unchanged.
---
 test/policy-verifier.e2e.test.mjs  | 21 ++++++++++++++-------
 test/windows-verifier.e2e.test.mjs | 21 ++++++++++++++-------
 2 files changed, 28 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)

